    "text": "Lookout Warns Travelers That Chinese Authorities Can Extract Data From Phones\nBy PYMNTS,\n10 hours agoChinese authorities are using new malware that enables them to extract data from devices to which they have physical access, TechCrunch reported Wednesday (July 16), citing its interview with Lookout Staff Security Intelligence Engineer Kristina Balaam. The malware allows them to access text messages, images, location histories, audio recordings, contacts...",
